{"id": "61157", "title": "王爷饶命", "author": "我家少爷是总攻", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 6, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/61/61157.htm", "intro": "人物：\r\n二王爷 二十八岁 职位 辅政王爷 有望提升\r\n汤圆 二十五岁 职位 如意楼专业唱曲的\r\n故事梗概：\r\n王爷因故去逛妓馆 偶遇小受 骤起激（）情无数 \r\n小倌得遇知音 以身相报 却牵扯出身世之谜", "base": "files/article/html/61/61157", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9001765.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9001766.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "9001767.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "9001770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "9001771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "9001773.html", "available": false}]}